The pictures here are BorderU6_*.bmp, U6_WOU_Scroll_bg.bmp and images/gumps/** (with the doll pictures avatar_U6_*.bmp, actor_U6*.bmp of images/gumps/doll)
of ScummVM's ultima.dat
(devtools/create_ultima/files/ultima6 in https://github.com/scummvm/scummvm), the art of
Nuvie's new style UI, converted to PNG unchanged (the doll pictures' colour key 0xf10fc4 made the others' 0x0070fc). They are part of ScummVM, distributed
under the GNU General Public License, version 3 or later: https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.html
gump_font.png and gump_font_widths.bin are Nuvie's font_gump_data and font_gump_w_data
(engines/ultima/nuvie/gui/the_font.h, GPL) as a picture in the doll gump's colours.
